{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1353442-kraig-blackwelder-quotes-on-aberrant-1st-edition","id":1353442,"title":"Kraig Blackwelder quotes on Aberrant 1st Edition?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Aberrant"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-12-07T15:59:24-08:00","id":1353442,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon5.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Kraig Blackwelder quotes on Aberrant 1st Edition?","content":"In the past there were a lot of second hand quotes I would read that supposedly Kraig Blackwelder (the second Developer for Aberrant 1st Edition) said. I never read them on a forum or other social media platform, &amp; I was wondering if anyone could recall the source of these quotes. (Most focus on Divis Mal.)<br /> <br /> One claim was that Caestus Pax was killed by Divis Mal after the Aberrant War.<br /> <br /> Another was that Divis Mal was a 2nd Generation Nova.<br /> <br /> And a 3rd was that Divis Mal was endowed with a phallus of similar proportions to an average member of Equus ferus.<br /> <br /> As you can see, some of these claims go through the interesting to irreverent but amusing, &amp; I would love to learn of their origin.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4428-daredevil","name":"Daredevil","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4428_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"404"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-09T04:23:05-08:00","id":1353757,"title":"","content":"Does anyone else recall these quotes being tossed around? (It was 20 years ago. God, time flies.) I was reminded about it while doing some recent searches on old RPG forums that are still around. The quotes\u2019 sources were, again, never cited.<br /> <br /> Perhaps posters were misquoting or lying about what Mr. Blackwelder had said. If my memory is right, the \u201cThis is not the Super Friends\u201d opening to the Aberrant Player\u2019s Guide did cause some dislike to him.<br /> <br /> I find it a pity we 1<sup>st</sup> Edition Aeon-verse fans did not gather writer/developer quotes together like latter Exalted fans did.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4428-daredevil","name":"Daredevil","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4428_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"404"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}